{"post_stream":{"posts":[{"id":504134,"name":"Kevin Carroll","username":"Kevin_Carroll","avatar_template":"https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/k/9fc348/{size}.png","created_at":"2026-09-30T16:39:35.034Z","cooked":"\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-504134-where-does-the-bug-appear-featureproduct-1\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-504134-where-does-the-bug-appear-featureproduct-1\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eWhere does the bug appear (feature/product)?\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGrok Bot\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-504134-describe-the-bug-2\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-504134-describe-the-bug-2\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eDescribe the Bug\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAsana connector sign-in fails with invalid_request: The redirect_uri parameter does not match a valid url for the application, since about 10:25 AM ET on 9/30. It affects my three Asana accounts, and the connector has now disappeared from the list.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-504134-steps-to-reproduce-3\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-504134-steps-to-reproduce-3\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eSteps to Reproduce\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSteps to reproduce:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIn Grok Bot, the Asana connector (Asana MCP) has been working normally for weeks, with three accounts: default, “cos” and “rls”.\u003cbr\u003e\nAt about 10:25 AM ET on 9/30/2026, all three accounts suddenly switched to needing authentication.\u003cbr\u003e\nStart the Asana sign-in from Grok Bot for any account.\u003cbr\u003e\nAsana’s OAuth page returns “invalid_request: The redirect_uri parameter does not match a valid url for the application” and never shows the approve screen.\u003cbr\u003e\nIt happens every time. I tried three times, including one forced re-auth, and got the same error each time.\u003cbr\u003e\nBy about 11:10 AM ET the Asana connector had disappeared from the agent’s connector list completely. Gmail, Calendar, Drive, Slack and others still work.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-504134-expected-behavior-4\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-504134-expected-behavior-4\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eExpected Behavior\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eExpected: the Asana sign-in completes and the connector reconnects.\u003cbr\u003e\nActual: the redirect_uri mismatch error, and now the connector is missing.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-504134-operating-system-5\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-504134-operating-system-5\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eOperating System\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWindows 10/11\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-504134-version-information-6\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-504134-version-information-6\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eVersion Information\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e0.63.0\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003egrokbot://app/v1/settings?id=update-channel\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-504134-does-this-stop-you-from-using-cursor-7\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-504134-does-this-stop-you-from-using-cursor-7\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eDoes this stop you from using Cursor\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eYes - Cursor is unusable\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":1,"post_type":1,"posts_count":2,"updated_at":"2026-09-30T16:39:42.024Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":6,"reads":4,"readers_count":3,"score":30.8,"yours":false,"topic_id":173426,"topic_slug":"asana-connector","display_username":"Kevin Carroll","primary_group_name":null,"flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_group_id":null,"badges_granted":[],"version":2,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"read":true,"user_title":"","bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[],"moderator":false,"admin":false,"staff":false,"user_id":140405,"hidden":false,"trust_level":0,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":false,"wiki":false,"post_url":"/t/asana-connector/173426/1","reactions":[],"current_user_reaction":null,"reaction_users_count":0,"current_user_used_main_reaction":false,"can_accept_answer":false,"can_unaccept_answer":false,"accepted_answer":false,"topic_accepted_answer":null,"can_vote":false},{"id":504236,"name":"Kevin Neilson","username":"kevinn","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/forum.cursor.com/kevinn/{size}/101206_2.png","created_at":"2026-09-30T19:52:35.229Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003eHey \u003ca class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/kevin_carroll\"\u003e@Kevin_Carroll\u003c/a\u003e, thanks for the report.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAround 10 AM ET, Asana stopped accepting the saved sign-in for your Asana connector, which is why all three accounts switched to needing authentication together. The connector itself is still saved on your account. It just drops out of the agent’s connector list until it is signed in again.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe redirect_uri error comes from Asana. It means the Asana app your connector is configured with (the one whose Client ID was entered when the connector was set up) doesn’t list the callback address Grok Bot uses for sign-in. Could you try this:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003col\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOpen the Asana developer console at \u003ca href=\"https://app.asana.com/0/my-apps\" class=\"inline-onebox\"\u003eLog in - Asana\u003c/a\u003e and select that app.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOpen its OAuth settings and find Redirect URLs.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAdd \u003ca href=\"https://www.cursor.com/agents/mcp/oauth/callback\" class=\"inline-onebox\"\u003eCursor Agent - Turn your ideas into code\u003c/a\u003e and save. Leave any existing URLs in place.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eIn Grok Bot, start the Asana sign-in again for the default account.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOnce that works, repeat the sign-in for “cos” and “rls”.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ol\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIf Asana still shows the redirect_uri error after step 4, reply with a screenshot of the app’s Redirect URLs list and the time you tried, and we’ll dig in further.\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":6,"post_type":1,"posts_count":2,"updated_at":"2026-09-30T19:52:35.229Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":0,"reads":2,"readers_count":1,"score":0.4,"yours":false,"topic_id":173426,"topic_slug":"asana-connector","display_username":"Kevin Neilson","primary_group_name":"CursorStaff","flair_name":"CursorStaff","flair_url":"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/original/3X/a/d/ad08adc640929ae1e98be69dab1ad0844cee99a0.png","flair_bg_color":"","flair_color":"","flair_group_id":42,"badges_granted":[],"version":1,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"link_counts":[{"url":"https://app.asana.com/0/my-apps","internal":false,"reflection":false,"title":"Log in - Asana","clicks":0},{"url":"https://www.cursor.com/agents/mcp/oauth/callback","internal":false,"reflection":false,"title":"Cursor Agent - Turn your ideas into code","clicks":0}],"read":true,"user_title":"","bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[],"moderator":true,"admin":true,"staff":true,"user_id":105146,"hidden":false,"trust_level":3,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":false,"wiki":false,"post_url":"/t/asana-connector/173426/6","reactions":[],"current_user_reaction":null,"reaction_users_count":0,"current_user_used_main_reaction":false,"can_accept_answer":false,"can_unaccept_answer":false,"accepted_answer":false,"topic_accepted_answer":null}],"stream":[504134,504236]},"timeline_lookup":[[1,0]],"suggested_topics":[],"tags":[{"id":47,"name":"mcp","slug":"mcp"},{"id":416,"name":"grok-bot","slug":"grok-bot"}],"tags_descriptions":{},"fancy_title":"Asana connector","id":173426,"title":"Asana connector","posts_count":2,"created_at":"2026-09-30